"Help" = "幫助";
"Support" = "獲取幫助";
"An inactive session means WrapPin's worker has ended. Other apps may need time to acquire a fresh real location." = "定位任務已結束，但其他 App 可能需要一些時間才能重新獲取真實位置。";
"This checks the saved pairing record and whether the paired iPhone is visible through LocalDevVPN. It never starts, changes, or stops your location." = "此檢查只驗證配對記錄和 LocalDevVPN 連接，不會啟動、修改或停止模擬定位。";
"Copies a status-only report you can paste into a bug report. It never includes locations, searches, pairing records, PINs, device names or error text." = "複製一份僅包含連接狀態的診斷報告，不含位置、搜尋、配對記錄、PIN、裝置名稱或錯誤原文。";
"Another VPN may affect local device connections. If it is appropriate for your network, compare a test with that VPN paused. Keep LocalDevVPN enabled when starting a location session." = "其他 VPN 可能影響本機連接。排障時可以暫時停用其他 VPN，但啟動模擬定位時必須保持 LocalDevVPN 已連接。";
"WrapPin has not detected another VPN. This is a troubleshooting check, not a diagnosis; an iOS scheduler rejection happens before the pairing connection starts." = "未檢測到其他 VPN。此結果僅用於排障；如果 iOS 在配對連接開始前拒絕任務，原因與 VPN 無關。";
