"Background mode missing" = "缺少背景定位設定";
"Temporarily unavailable" = "暫時無法獲取更新";
"The current simulation can still work in the foreground, but background continuity is unavailable. Check Location access for WrapPin in Settings." = "當前模擬定位仍可在前景執行，但無法保證切換到其他 App 後持續。請到系統設定檢查 WrapPin 的定位權限。";
"WrapPin has not detected another VPN. This is a troubleshooting check, not a diagnosis." = "未檢測到其他 VPN。此結果僅用於排障，不代表已經確定問題原因。";
"Tunnel App" = "隧道跳轉應用";
"Selects the app to open when WrapPin cannot reach the paired iPhone." = "選擇裝置連接不可用時要開啟的應用。";
"If the paired iPhone is unreachable, WrapPin opens this app on Wi-Fi or mobile data. Turn on its tunnel yourself, then return to WrapPin. This only selects the app to open; it does not ensure that app's tunnel supports device pairing." = "Wi-Fi 或流動網絡下，若無法連接已配對的 iPhone，就開啟所選應用。請自行開啟隧道後返回 WrapPin。這裏只決定跳轉目標，不保證所選隧道支援裝置配對連接。";
"If the paired iPhone is unreachable, WrapPin asks LocalDevVPN to connect and return. If it does not return automatically, check its tunnel and come back to WrapPin." = "若無法連接已配對的 iPhone，WrapPin 會請求 LocalDevVPN 建立隧道並返回。若沒有自動返回，請檢查隧道狀態，再手動回到 WrapPin。";
"On Wi-Fi, WrapPin opens LocalDevVPN if the paired iPhone is unreachable. On mobile data, it uses LocalDevVPN's connect-and-return flow before continuing. If it does not return automatically, check its tunnel and come back to WrapPin." = "使用 Wi-Fi 時，若無法連接已配對的 iPhone，WrapPin 會開啟 LocalDevVPN；使用流動網絡時，會先走 LocalDevVPN 建立隧道並返回的流程。若沒有自動返回，請檢查隧道後手動回到 WrapPin。";
"WrapPin asks Shadowrocket to connect its VPN only when it cannot find the paired iPhone's device connection. Shadowrocket requires Include Route 10.7.0.1/32 turned on in its Settings. If mobile data fails, use Wi-Fi. WrapPin cannot inspect Shadowrocket's VPN switch." = "僅在找不到已配對 iPhone 的裝置連接時，WrapPin 才會請求 Shadowrocket 開啟 VPN。Shadowrocket 需要在「設定 → 其它」中開啟「包含路由 10.7.0.1/32」；流動網絡失敗時請改用 Wi-Fi。WrapPin 無法讀取 Shadowrocket 的 VPN 開關狀態。";
"WrapPin asks Surge to start its selected configuration only when it cannot find the paired iPhone's device connection. Surge 5.23+ requires 10.7.0.1/32 in tun-included-routes and 10.7.0.1 = reflect in IP Rewrite. If mobile data fails, use Wi-Fi. WrapPin cannot inspect Surge's VPN switch." = "僅在找不到已配對 iPhone 的裝置連接時，WrapPin 才會請求 Surge 啟動當前設定。Surge 5.23+ 需要在 tun-included-routes 中加入 10.7.0.1/32，並在 IP Rewrite 中設定 10.7.0.1 = reflect；流動網絡失敗時請改用 Wi-Fi。WrapPin 無法讀取 Surge 的 VPN 開關狀態。";
"WrapPin asks Loon to turn on its VPN only when it cannot find the paired iPhone's device connection. Loon build 1007+ requires include-tun = 10.7.0.1/32 and an enabled plugin with 10.7.0.1 = reflect in IP Rewrite. If mobile data fails, use Wi-Fi. WrapPin cannot inspect Loon's VPN switch." = "僅在找不到已配對 iPhone 的裝置連接時，WrapPin 才會請求 Loon 開啟 VPN。Loon Build 1007+ 需要設定 include-tun = 10.7.0.1/32，並啓用在 IP Rewrite 中聲明 10.7.0.1 = reflect 的插件；流動網絡失敗時請改用 Wi-Fi。WrapPin 無法讀取 Loon 的 VPN 開關狀態。";
"Opening tunnel app" = "正在開啟隧道應用";
"Opening %@…" = "正在開啟 %@…";
"WrapPin asks %@ to turn on its VPN only when it cannot find the paired iPhone's device connection. Its configuration must send connections to 10.7.0.1 back to this iPhone; check the result in Connection Health. If mobile data fails, use Wi-Fi. WrapPin cannot inspect its VPN switch." = "僅在找不到已配對 iPhone 的裝置連接時，WrapPin 才會請求 %@ 開啟 VPN。它的設定需要把發往 10.7.0.1 的連接回送到本機，可在「連接檢測」中查看結果；流動網絡失敗時請改用 Wi-Fi。WrapPin 無法讀取它的 VPN 開關狀態。";
"WrapPin opens Quantumult X when it cannot find the paired iPhone's device connection. Quantumult X has no link that turns on its VPN, so turn it on yourself and return to WrapPin. Its configuration must send connections to 10.7.0.1 back to this iPhone; check the result in Connection Health. If mobile data fails, use Wi-Fi." = "找不到已配對 iPhone 的裝置連接時，WrapPin 會開啟 Quantumult X。Quantumult X 沒有開啟 VPN 的鏈接，請手動開啟後返回 WrapPin。它的設定需要把發往 10.7.0.1 的連接回送到本機，可在「連接檢測」中查看結果；流動網絡失敗時請改用 Wi-Fi。";
"WrapPin opens sing-box when it cannot find the paired iPhone's device connection. sing-box has no link that turns on its VPN, so turn it on yourself and return to WrapPin. sing-box 1.12+ requires loopback_address set to 10.7.0.1 in its TUN inbound. If mobile data fails, use Wi-Fi." = "找不到已配對 iPhone 的裝置連接時，WrapPin 會開啟 sing-box。sing-box 沒有開啟 VPN 的鏈接，請手動開啟後返回 WrapPin。sing-box 1.12+ 需要在 TUN 入站中把 loopback_address 設為 10.7.0.1；流動網絡失敗時請改用 Wi-Fi。";
"Turn on the tunnel in the selected app, then return to WrapPin." = "請在所選應用中手動開啟隧道，然後返回 WrapPin。";
"Wait for LocalDevVPN to connect and return. If it does not, return to WrapPin yourself." = "等待 LocalDevVPN 建立隧道並返回；若沒有自動返回，請手動回到 WrapPin。";
"Could not open the selected tunnel app. Check that it is installed and supports app links." = "無法開啟所選隧道應用。請確認它已安裝，並支援應用跳轉鏈接。";
"Get %@" = "安裝 %@";
"Open %@" = "開啟 %@";
"WrapPin has not found the paired iPhone's device connection yet." = "WrapPin 還沒有找到這台已配對 iPhone 的裝置連接。";
"Make sure the selected app's tunnel is connected, then try again. Choose mobile data only when you're actually using 4G or 5G." = "請確認所選應用的隧道已連接，然後再試一次。只有確實在使用 4G/5G 時才選擇流動網絡流程。";
"Use Wi-Fi with %@" = "請連接 Wi-Fi 後使用 %@ 再試一次";
"%@ may not provide the device connection WrapPin needs over mobile data. Connect to Wi-Fi, keep a compatible tunnel on, then return and try again." = "流動網絡下，%@ 可能無法建立 WrapPin 所需的裝置連接。請連接 Wi-Fi，保持兼容隧道開啟，再返回再試一次。";
"Make sure the selected app's tunnel is connected, switch mobile data off briefly, then return to WrapPin." = "確認所選應用的隧道已連接，暫時關閉流動數據，然後返回 WrapPin。";
"Device Tunnel" = "裝置隧道";
"Check the selected tunnel app, then run the connection check or try starting the location again." = "請檢查所選隧道應用，再執行連接檢測或重新啟動模擬定位。";
"This checks the saved pairing record and whether the paired iPhone is reachable through a compatible device tunnel. It cannot inspect another app's VPN switch or change your location." = "這裏檢查儲存的配對記錄及能否通過兼容的裝置隧道連接本機，無法讀取其他應用的 VPN 開關，也不會更改位置。";
"Another VPN may affect local device connections. Keep a compatible device tunnel enabled when starting a location session; a regular proxy alone may not work." = "其他 VPN 可能影響本機連接。啟動定位工作階段時需要兼容的裝置隧道，僅有普通代理可能無法使用。";
"%@ on mobile data may not expose the device connection WrapPin needs. Use Wi-Fi if the connection check fails." = "流動網絡下，%@ 可能無法提供 WrapPin 所需的裝置連接。若檢測失敗，請改用 Wi-Fi。";
"Device tunnel reachability can only be checked on a physical iPhone." = "只能在實體 iPhone 上檢測裝置隧道連通性。";
"The paired iPhone was announced, but its tunnel address was not reachable. Reconnect the selected tunnel and check its device and tunnel IP settings." = "已發現配對的 iPhone，但隧道地址無法連接。請重連所選隧道，並檢查裝置 IP 和隧道 IP 設定。";
"A device announcement is visible, but it does not match the paired iPhone. Restart the selected tunnel and try again." = "已發現裝置廣播，但與配對的 iPhone 不匹配。請重啓所選隧道後再試一次。";
"This iPhone was not reachable through the device tunnel. Check that a compatible tunnel is connected. On mobile data, switch data off briefly and run the check again." = "無法通過裝置隧道連接這部 iPhone。請確認兼容隧道已連接；若使用流動網絡，請暫時關閉流動數據後再次檢測。";
"This iPhone was not reachable through the device tunnel. If you are using an external tunnel app on mobile data, connect to Wi-Fi and run the check again." = "無法通過裝置隧道連接這部 iPhone。如果正通過流動網絡使用外部隧道應用，請連接 Wi-Fi 後重新檢測。";
"The pairing record matches this iPhone and it is reachable through the device tunnel. The iPhone verifies the pairing itself when a location session starts." = "配對記錄與這部 iPhone 匹配，且可通過裝置隧道連接。配對本身會在開始定位時由 iPhone 校驗。";

