"Walking routes" = "步行路線";
"Ask Apple Maps for walking routes from your current point to the selected destination before anything starts. When there are several, choose one on the card or tap it on the map." = "開始前，先通過 Apple 地圖規劃從當前位置到目的地的步行路線。有多條路線時，可在卡片上選擇，或直接輕點地圖上的路線。";
