"The default address matches this build's existing tunnel. Change only the local IPv4 address if another tool needs a different one. The peer stays at 10.7.0.1. Changes take effect the next time the tunnel starts." = "預設地址沿用已驗證的隧道設定。僅當其他工具需要不同的本機地址時才修改；對端地址保持 10.7.0.1。修改會在下次開啟隧道時生效。";
"How It Works" = "使用説明";
