"The app and its tunnel extension both need signing profiles that allow Packet Tunnel. If iOS rejects the VPN configuration, check the signed installation and the VPN entry in iPhone Settings." = "App 和內置擴展的簽名設定都必須允許 Packet Tunnel。若 iOS 拒絕 VPN 設定，請檢查簽名後的安裝檔，以及 iPhone 設定中的 VPN 條目。";
