"Start Cycling" = "開始單車模擬";
"Starting cycling session…" = "正在啟動單車模擬…";
"Preparing cycle" = "正在準備單車路線";
"Cycling" = "正在踩單車";
"Cycle paused" = "單車模擬已暫停";
"Resume Cycling" = "繼續單車模擬";
"Cycling to %@" = "踩單車前往 %@";
"WrapPin closed before it could confirm that the simulated cycle to %@ ended. Continue from the last saved point or restore this iPhone's real location." = "WrapPin 關閉前未能確認前往 %@ 的模擬單車已結束。可從上次儲存的位置繼續，或恢復本機真實位置。";
"No cycling route was found for this destination. Apple Maps cycling directions are not available in every region. You can draw a custom route or import GPX instead." = "沒有找到前往該地點的單車路線。Apple 地圖並非在所有地區都提供單車路線，可改為繪製自訂路線或匯入 GPX。";
"Cycling directions are unavailable. Check Location access and your internet connection. If Apple Maps has no cycling coverage here, draw a custom route or import GPX instead." = "暫時無法規劃單車路線。請檢查定位權限和網絡。如果 Apple 地圖不支援此地區的單車路線，可改為繪製自訂路線或匯入 GPX。";
"Cycling speed" = "單車速度";
"Simulated cycling speed" = "模擬單車速度";
"Constant route speed · 1–60 km/h" = "勻速沿路線移動 · 1–60 公里／小時";
"Follow simulated bicycle" = "跟隨模擬單車";
"Search for a place or tap the map, then start a fixed location or preview a walking, cycling or driving route." = "搜尋地點或輕點地圖，即可模擬固定位置，也可以先預覽步行、單車或駕駛路線。";
"Start a fixed location or preview a walking, cycling or driving route." = "開始固定位置模擬，或先預覽步行、單車或駕駛路線。";
"Fixed, walking, cycling or driving session started" = "開始固定位置、步行、單車或駕駛模擬";
"Ask Apple Maps for cycling directions. Coverage varies by region; if no cycling route is available, draw a custom route or import GPX. Walking or driving routes are never substituted automatically." = "通過 Apple 地圖規劃單車路線。支援範圍因地區而異；若無單車路線，可繪製自訂路線或匯入 GPX。不會自動替換為步行或駕駛路線。";
"Set a constant cycling speed from 1 to 60 km/h. The default is 18 km/h. You can pause, resume and restore just like other routes." = "可設定 1–60 公里／小時的勻速單車模擬速度，預設為 18 公里／小時。與其他路線一樣，支援暫停、繼續以及恢復真實位置。";
"Already use a compatible tunnel? Choose it here; LocalDevVPN is not required." = "已在使用兼容的隧道？可在這裏選擇，無需安裝 LocalDevVPN。";
"In Shadowrocket, enable Include Route 10.7.0.1/32 in Settings, connect its VPN, then return to WrapPin." = "在 Shadowrocket 的「設定」中開啟「包含路由 10.7.0.1/32」，連接 VPN 後返回 WrapPin。";

